                                "sense_id": "ed0b5286-d0ed-334e-9de4-14923ec47996",
                                "text": "how to forge his sword upon the stithy, as well as how to use it in battle"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc73352b-97ae-37ed-a883-2f396ea92bb8",
